 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_81107615d4cd07801fc1",
   "sourceHash": "81107615d4cd07801fc1da3abfc8a48543fcd065be1536797d25a7692ab89165",
   "text": "瑜伽与阿育吠陀相结合，是净化身心、觉察当下的理想方式……",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d65cf5cb2d6c5fc96569",
   "sourceHash": "d65cf5cb2d6c5fc96569113fb7827c69f2c8d521b1f7d55161f0abaefb202750",
   "text": "一个人坐在水边。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_100336d1506e89f484b8",
   "sourceHash": "100336d1506e89f484b8a43acd42e21e98965a0724d192bdc4cf49596f6452eb",
   "text": "由知名教练 Santhosh Babu、艾扬格瑜伽习练者 Raageshwari、美国全息呼吸……",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source is a truncated teaser ending mid-phrase ('American Holotropic…'); translated as a matching fragment."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5a13d49853d2758e8e88",
   "sourceHash": "5a13d49853d2758e8e8863c155549a6d29a75a64508a420ed66aaa9a2a459e87",
   "text": "一个人在小屋外练习后弯。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c12d8f6fdea6e2db1ae4",
   "sourceHash": "c12d8f6fdea6e2db1ae489802c034a0986e4cedf5631ec6a1ae652492ed396d4",
   "text": "帕拉卡德（Palakkad）是一个坐落于西高止山脉秀美怀抱中的小县，是最令人神清气爽的……",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c19fd071ae0b1de59977",
   "sourceHash": "c19fd071ae0b1de599771e625889ee774e079145d88a65320421f6bef7fd4e91",
   "text": "一盘配有柑橘类水果的沙拉。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d7a97be9d0a99fd9bded",
   "sourceHash": "d7a97be9d0a99fd9bded908372c0f4b32f6fc4d0c50d41f6990992e9ac2119e9",
   "text": "在喀拉拉邦帕拉卡德的 Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村举办的厨师静修活动。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ae147bf29c6f1272aa07",
   "sourceHash": "ae147bf29c6f1272aa07c22f3ecfcc72467fbae154d055c249cd039c43705f65",
   "text": "花园全景：藤蔓覆盖的砖砌建筑，入口处设有象神（Ganesha）神龛。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2f2ac992023cc816a1d8",
   "sourceHash": "2f2ac992023cc816a1d82e818b20e636fefe9a6cdcdc90a419c6d6071b1ed473",
   "text": "医院、治疗室、别墅、瑜伽厅、厨房及周边乡野的照片——均为实地拍摄，并按章节编排。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_aab4be14015d4ad05835",
   "sourceHash": "aab4be14015d4ad05835ab68b3f2d0f82373bd10a0d68b98eb28a77cd34c280f",
   "text": "医院及其园区",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ad7b585551eccb09eb55",
   "sourceHash": "ad7b585551eccb09eb55a8dc52a9e170de4b12eed8f91a66e1640dd9a6093e75",
   "text": "Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村是一座医院园区，由砖石结构的治疗楼、患者小屋和草坪组成，一条石砌水渠贯穿其间。这些照片展示了患者抵达时所见的接待处、廊道和花园。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1a4d7c2ed8e1faf9969a",
   "sourceHash": "1a4d7c2ed8e1faf9969ac3470357351ba9ac543ce626db502f73764bd1e176b5",
   "text": "查看完整园区图库",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_44ff245c6fb658dc0c87",
   "sourceHash": "44ff245c6fb658dc0c8778e80bafff08a31f8f10bf786fc62fc1bed759fa3e18",
   "text": "天窗下的理疗门厅：水渠中三座分层石砌喷泉；拱形治疗室门。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_949ab6274d7609975dea",
   "sourceHash": "949ab6274d7609975dea4c8c05d0a774aff603e942f63ec77453fb78be9baa80",
   "text": "自由形态泳池及池畔平台的俯瞰全景，一端设有躺椅",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c991c1a22371474694d6",
   "sourceHash": "c991c1a22371474694d683e76a260c1eaf76791587a41706bbdaff6ef7f26a59",
   "text": "自由形态泳池及池畔平台的俯瞰全景，一端设有躺椅。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_50d61157eba1f3516aee",
   "sourceHash": "50d61157eba1f3516aeebe3410644093be8b0bc790df517038bfeb0fc5a5baa6",
   "text": "带柱廊的有顶走廊，木衬坡屋顶配木质交叉栏杆，穿过花园连接各砖石治疗楼",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_84bdd67a64a6e48b73fb",
   "sourceHash": "84bdd67a64a6e48b73fbdeb87db740f1112481bd480d310e6243669c2e628561",
   "text": "带柱廊的有顶走廊，木衬坡屋顶。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_92be33e5926ba621be40",
   "sourceHash": "92be33e5926ba621be40755ef40b7035c3bbbea2da5e6f196beb9da945ccca26",
   "text": "接待休息区，上方为高挑的锥形梁架顶棚；清水砖墙上挂有创始人肖像",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
